tirlo y entrar directamente a la partida.\n\n\u2022 Practica el reconocimiento de palabras en espa\u00f1ol.\n\u2022 Explora un escenario ambientado en el Viejo Oeste.\n\u2022 Consigue estrellas y consulta tus resultados.\n\u2022 Reinicia la partida para volver a intentarlo.\n\u2022 Despl\u00e1zate y gira con los joysticks de los mandos.\n\nIncluye pausa y salida con confirmaci\u00f3n. La interfaz y la narraci\u00f3n est\u00e1n en espa\u00f1ol.\n", "short_description": "Explora un pueblo del Viejo Oeste y pon a prueba tu reconocimiento de palabras en espa\u00f1ol. Encuentra las palabras correctas, evita las trampas y consigue estrellas en una experiencia educativa de realidad virtual con tutorial narrado.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.academusdigital.com/politica-de-privacidad-apps/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Academus Digital", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.academusdigital.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1330296240177221"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1619560812874717"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1619560812874717"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790287380, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1619560812874717"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_bin